msgctxt "settings"
msgid "A feature of this fork that denies all AI-initiated outgoing connections (AI providers, agent tools, MCP servers, external agent processes) by default. Connections of the IDE's own tooling, such as language servers and extensions, are not affected. Review, add and remove the hosts that are allowed."
